# Hard Real-Time Motion Control Platform

A hard real-time closed-loop motion control platform based on the Texas Instruments TM4C123GXL LaunchPad.

## Hardware

- TM4C123GXL LaunchPad
- TM4C123GH6PM
- DC motor
- Quadrature encoder
- Motor driver

## Software

- C
- ARM Cortex-M4F
- PlatformIO
- libopencm3
- ARM GCC

## Project Goals

- Bare-metal peripheral development
- Deterministic periodic scheduling
- PWM motor control
- Quadrature encoder feedback
- PID position control
- Deadline monitoring
- Execution-time measurement
- Jitter measurement
- Safety/fault handling

## Architecture

```text
Encoder
   │
   ▼
Feedback
   │
   ▼
Control Scheduler
   │
   ▼
PID Controller
   │
   ▼
PWM
   │
   ▼
Motor
   │
   └──────────► Encoder